    {
      "id": "claim_365c6e026249406f8f4fcba3b70101a5",
      "statement": "The per-page image count in triage is best-effort by design: it swallows a specific set of pypdf exceptions raised by malformed PDFs and continues with a lower count instead of failing the document.",
